# Emulator: the paks are virtio disks and the initramfs has already mounted them at
# /mnt/tvservice, /mnt/otncabi, /mnt/otycabi, /mnt/fonts and /mnt/license (webOS 4 has no smartkey).
# /mnt/lg/ciplus/cert (mmcblk0p14) has no pak in the firmware and is left empty. (W18R's stock
# fstab: p14, p30 and p32-p34, p36.) The bind fstabs of this directory are the stock ones.
